00:01:42.880 --> 00:01:45.480 line:100%
KEEP QUIET

00:01:45.560 --> 00:01:49.200 line:100%
SURGICAL WARD

00:01:53.320 --> 00:01:54.200 line:100%
Sir.

00:02:12.480 --> 00:02:13.400 line:100%
Sir.

00:02:15.840 --> 00:02:17.080 line:100%
What are you doing here?

00:02:17.640 --> 00:02:20.640 line:100%
You're getting discharged today.
I came to help you pack.

00:02:22.400 --> 00:02:23.520 line:100%
Come on.

00:02:30.160 --> 00:02:31.120 line:100%
<i>PARADOX THINKING</i>
<i>IN CRIMINAL INVESTIGATIONS</i>

00:02:31.200 --> 00:02:32.080 line:100%
BY RAN FANGXU

00:02:33.960 --> 00:02:35.480 line:100%
Why are you reading that?

00:02:35.560 --> 00:02:37.400 line:100%
Just brushing up.

00:02:40.040 --> 00:02:41.040 line:100%
Hey.

00:02:42.200 --> 00:02:43.120 line:100%
Give it back.

00:02:45.840 --> 00:02:48.440 line:100%
I wrote that two years ago
when I didn't know any better.

00:02:48.520 --> 00:02:50.080 line:100%
It's all just theory.

00:02:51.320 --> 00:02:53.000 line:100%
That's what I used to think too.

00:02:53.080 --> 00:02:54.720 line:100%
But now,

00:02:55.320 --> 00:02:58.920 line:100%
your so-called theory
actually holds up in practice.

00:02:59.000 --> 00:02:59.840 line:100%
It's helpful.

00:03:03.960 --> 00:03:05.480 line:100%
By the way, sir,

00:03:05.560 --> 00:03:07.800 line:100%
what are you planning to do
after you're discharged?

00:03:13.640 --> 00:03:16.440 line:100%
Can I stay on
with the Criminal Department?

00:03:17.880 --> 00:03:19.160 line:100%
Of course.

00:03:20.160 --> 00:03:21.720 line:100%
You got injured on duty.

00:03:21.800 --> 00:03:24.000 line:100%
The team will make room for you.

00:03:25.800 --> 00:03:26.800 line:100%
Then I'll stay.

00:03:27.560 --> 00:03:28.480 line:100%
Good.

00:03:38.440 --> 00:03:39.760 line:100%
What about Xiaohe?

00:03:40.640 --> 00:03:42.440 line:100%
I need to look after her,

00:03:42.520 --> 00:03:44.040 line:100%
and I have cases to crack.

00:03:44.680 --> 00:03:46.480 line:100%
Cases? What case?

00:03:48.120 --> 00:03:51.000 line:100%
Do you really think Xu Meng is dead?

00:03:54.040 --> 00:03:57.080 line:100%
I've been thinking. A case
that dragged on for five years,

00:03:57.160 --> 00:03:59.840 line:100%
and suddenly it gets wrapped up
in three days. That's way too smooth.

00:04:00.440 --> 00:04:03.120 line:100%
Could there be a possibility that Xu Meng

00:04:03.200 --> 00:04:05.840 line:100%
got away from Wu Shanlong a long time ago,

00:04:05.920 --> 00:04:08.640 line:100%
and he just left her shoes behind?

00:04:08.720 --> 00:04:09.680 line:100%
That's possible.

00:04:10.760 --> 00:04:13.440 line:100%
As long as we have
solid evidence and leads,

00:04:14.040 --> 00:04:16.560 line:100%
I'll go to Director Zou
and ask to reopen the case.

00:04:17.280 --> 00:04:18.319 line:100%
Director Zou?

00:04:18.400 --> 00:04:19.520 line:100%
Why him?

00:04:19.600 --> 00:04:21.800 line:100%
Shouldn't we report to Captain Feng?

00:04:23.400 --> 00:04:25.800 line:100%
Captain Feng retired last week.

00:04:28.760 --> 00:04:30.160 line:100%
So that means…

00:04:31.000 --> 00:04:32.240 line:100%
You brat.

00:04:36.200 --> 00:04:37.480 line:100%
Captain Ran.

00:04:38.480 --> 00:04:39.800 line:100%
Come on. Don't do that.

00:04:40.720 --> 00:04:42.160 line:100%
You,

00:04:42.240 --> 00:04:45.120 line:100%
get back to work. Don't waste time here.

00:04:45.200 --> 00:04:47.320 line:100%
-Go.
-About Xu Meng's case?

00:04:48.760 --> 00:04:49.920 line:100%
No rush.

00:04:50.000 --> 00:04:50.840 line:100%
I'll think it through some more.

00:04:53.320 --> 00:04:55.560 line:100%
-I'm going then.
-Go on.

00:04:55.640 --> 00:04:57.080 line:100%
Hurry.

00:05:13.600 --> 00:05:17.720 line:20%
FOUR MONTHS LATER, EARLY WINTER

00:05:17.800 --> 00:05:19.760 line:100%
The theft ring is hiding
in the urban village.

00:05:19.840 --> 00:05:21.640 line:100%
If we lock it down,
we can take them all in one sweep.

00:05:21.720 --> 00:05:23.240 line:100%
There are so few of us.

00:05:23.320 --> 00:05:24.440 line:100%
How are we supposed to seal it off?

00:05:24.520 --> 00:05:25.640 line:100%
What about the northeast corner?

00:05:25.720 --> 00:05:27.080 line:100%
How do we block that? You tell me.

00:05:36.240 --> 00:05:37.560 line:100%
Is the arrest plan ready?

00:05:37.640 --> 00:05:39.720 line:100%
We are working it out.

00:05:40.240 --> 00:05:42.360 line:100%
The urban-village area is complicated.

00:05:44.520 --> 00:05:45.560 line:100%
Where's Ran Fangxu?

00:05:47.280 --> 00:05:48.520 line:100%
He was here just now.

00:05:52.320 --> 00:05:54.680 line:100%
Captain Ran. Captain Ran.

00:05:54.760 --> 00:05:55.640 line:100%
Wake up.

00:05:57.560 --> 00:05:58.840 line:100%
Captain Ran. Director Zou is here.

00:06:00.080 --> 00:06:00.920 line:100%
Director Zou,

00:06:01.000 --> 00:06:03.280 line:100%
I pulled an all-nighter last night.
I'm so tired. Can't keep my eyes open.

00:06:05.320 --> 00:06:06.320 line:100%
I'm here.

00:06:10.520 --> 00:06:12.360 line:100%
Get out. Go wake yourself up outside.

00:06:13.280 --> 00:06:14.080 line:100%
Yes, sir.

00:06:17.600 --> 00:06:19.160 line:100%
This group of thieves
stole 1.5 million in cash

00:06:19.240 --> 00:06:22.200 line:100%
from the Railway Administration
and is hiding in the urban village.

00:06:22.280 --> 00:06:24.320 line:100%
The tricky part is the northeast corner.

00:06:24.400 --> 00:06:27.520 line:100%
In this corner, there are over
a dozen paths of all kinds

00:06:27.600 --> 00:06:29.840 line:100%
and plenty of hidden openings like these.

00:06:30.840 --> 00:06:32.280 line:100%
We've tried multiple plans,

00:06:32.360 --> 00:06:35.320 line:100%
but still can't fully block
Luandongzi's escape routes.

00:06:42.760 --> 00:06:44.120 line:100%
Director Zou,

00:06:44.200 --> 00:06:46.840 line:100%
should we call in armed police for backup?

00:07:00.120 --> 00:07:00.960 line:100%
Director Zou.

00:07:02.600 --> 00:07:04.320 line:100%
Leave the northeast corner to me.

00:07:05.240 --> 00:07:08.400 line:100%
-Problem solved!
-All good then!

00:07:08.480 --> 00:07:10.080 line:100%
-That'd be great.
-Good then.

00:07:11.080 --> 00:07:13.320 line:100%
If your captain is willing
to stake his life on it,

00:07:14.120 --> 00:07:16.040 line:100%
-then it's settled.
-Wait.

00:07:16.120 --> 00:07:17.360 line:100%
-Zhao Jie.
-Yes, sir.

00:07:17.880 --> 00:07:20.080 line:100%
-Put that into the plan.
-Don't.

00:07:20.760 --> 00:07:21.840 line:100%
Director Zou,

00:07:21.920 --> 00:07:24.040 line:100%
I never said I'd stake my life.

00:07:25.760 --> 00:07:27.120 line:100%
-Did he or not?
-He did.

00:07:29.640 --> 00:07:32.160 line:100%
SOLIDARITY

00:07:41.880 --> 00:07:43.200 line:100%
We're short one. Just waiting on you.

00:07:43.280 --> 00:07:44.320 line:100%
Hurry up.

00:07:52.280 --> 00:07:53.560 line:100%
Has Captain Ran
gone to the northeast corner?

00:07:53.640 --> 00:07:54.880 line:100%
He has. Don't worry.

00:08:10.160 --> 00:08:12.640 line:100%
So sorry. Sorry.

00:08:18.360 --> 00:08:19.080 line:100%
Move.

00:08:20.120 --> 00:08:21.320 line:100%
Stop!

00:08:23.360 --> 00:08:24.240 line:100%
-Cut him off over there.
-Go.

00:08:25.520 --> 00:08:27.200 line:100%
-Stop.
-Stop.

00:08:27.800 --> 00:08:28.920 line:100%
-Don't run.
-Watch out.

00:08:29.000 --> 00:08:29.840 line:100%
Don't run.

00:08:49.360 --> 00:08:51.120 line:100%
Two of you, go around and box him in.

00:08:58.440 --> 00:09:00.440 line:100%
No one is stopping me.

00:09:07.840 --> 00:09:09.600 line:100%
<i>He walked right into it. Easy.</i>

00:09:09.680 --> 00:09:10.680 line:100%
<i>Don't scratch my car.</i>

00:09:15.320 --> 00:09:16.000 line:100%
POLICE

00:09:16.080 --> 00:09:16.920 line:100%
Get out.

00:09:18.400 --> 00:09:19.760 line:100%
Out of the car.

00:09:19.840 --> 00:09:20.920 line:100%
Don't shoot.

00:09:21.000 --> 00:09:22.320 line:100%
I surrender.

00:09:22.400 --> 00:09:24.120 line:100%
-Take him!
-I surrender.

00:09:25.200 --> 00:09:25.960 line:100%
Ow!

00:09:26.040 --> 00:09:27.040 line:100%
Cuff him.

00:09:27.120 --> 00:09:28.800 line:100%
-Easy.
-Don't move.

00:09:28.880 --> 00:09:30.160 line:100%
Take him away.

00:09:31.680 --> 00:09:32.920 line:100%
Officer,

00:09:33.000 --> 00:09:34.280 line:100%
I have something to report.

00:09:34.360 --> 00:09:35.400 line:100%
I can help.

00:09:35.480 --> 00:09:37.880 line:100%
The property manager
of Yuanlongli, Qian Dajun.

00:09:37.960 --> 00:09:40.240 line:100%
He's bad news.

00:09:40.320 --> 00:09:41.400 line:100%
-Take him back for interrogation.
-Yes, sir.

00:09:41.480 --> 00:09:42.680 line:100%
-Officer! Trust me!
-Move.

00:09:42.760 --> 00:09:44.040 line:100%
Trust me!

00:09:44.120 --> 00:09:45.680 line:100%
-Move.
-Trust me!

00:09:45.760 --> 00:09:46.800 line:100%
I can help!

00:09:48.240 --> 00:09:49.520 line:100%
Captain Ran,

00:09:49.600 --> 00:09:52.240 line:100%
next time you have
something like this, call me in.

00:09:52.320 --> 00:09:55.040 line:100%
I don't often get to play cop like this.

00:09:55.120 --> 00:09:56.480 line:100%
-Thank you, Sun.
-Not at all.

00:09:56.560 --> 00:09:57.920 line:100%
-Appreciate it, Captain Sun.
-Of course.

00:09:58.000 --> 00:09:59.280 line:100%
We couldn't have
pulled this off without you.

00:09:59.360 --> 00:10:00.440 line:100%
Come.

00:10:00.520 --> 00:10:02.360 line:100%
-Good work.
-No problem.

00:10:03.880 --> 00:10:05.400 line:100%
MR. ZHANG

00:10:08.720 --> 00:10:10.280 line:100%
Hello, Mr. Zhang?

00:10:11.000 --> 00:10:12.040 line:100%
I'm so sorry, Mr. Zhang.

00:10:12.120 --> 00:10:13.720 line:100%
Please calm down. I'll handle it.

00:10:13.800 --> 00:10:14.800 line:100%
I'll deal with it right away.

00:10:14.880 --> 00:10:21.200 line:20%
NEIGHBORHOOD EAR CLEANING

00:10:32.160 --> 00:10:32.920 line:100%
CANDESARTAN TABLETS

00:10:46.200 --> 00:10:48.760 line:100%
Mister, are you from this neighborhood?

00:10:50.280 --> 00:10:51.440 line:100%
No.

00:10:52.480 --> 00:10:54.120 line:100%
You look familiar.

00:10:56.320 --> 00:10:58.000 line:100%
Back in 1997, I came to ask about

00:10:59.040 --> 00:11:00.880 line:100%
your brother and his daughter
who went missing.

00:11:05.440 --> 00:11:07.040 line:100%
I remember now.

00:11:07.120 --> 00:11:08.880 line:100%
You're that police officer.

00:11:09.680 --> 00:11:12.800 line:100%
Officer, any news about my niece?

00:11:16.760 --> 00:11:18.840 line:100%
It doesn't look good.

00:11:19.400 --> 00:11:22.160 line:100%
That poor girl has had a hard life.

00:11:22.240 --> 00:11:25.720 line:100%
She used to have someone
she was going to marry.

00:11:25.800 --> 00:11:27.040 line:100%
He was from out of town.

00:11:27.120 --> 00:11:28.920 line:100%
He came to Weiyang a few times.

00:11:29.000 --> 00:11:30.240 line:100%
He's from a decent family.

00:11:31.000 --> 00:11:32.840 line:100%
If they'd gotten married,

00:11:32.920 --> 00:11:35.480 line:100%
things might've turned out differently.

00:11:36.400 --> 00:11:37.640 line:100%
She had a boyfriend?

00:11:37.720 --> 00:11:38.840 line:100%
Why didn't you mention that before?

00:11:38.920 --> 00:11:41.480 line:100%
They lost touch a long time ago.

00:11:41.560 --> 00:11:43.000 line:100%
My brother was to blame.

00:11:43.080 --> 00:11:45.080 line:100%
He didn't approve of him
and wouldn't let them be together.

00:11:45.160 --> 00:11:47.720 line:100%
He forced them apart.

00:11:49.960 --> 00:11:52.200 line:100%
Do you remember his name?

00:11:52.280 --> 00:11:53.560 line:100%
What's the name?

00:11:54.080 --> 00:11:55.440 line:100%
It was something nice.

00:11:56.040 --> 00:11:57.840 line:100%
What's his name again?

00:11:58.440 --> 00:12:01.040 line:100%
Qiming. Wan Qiming.

00:12:01.840 --> 00:12:02.920 line:100%
Wan Qiming.

00:12:04.160 --> 00:12:06.320 line:100%
What did he look like?

00:12:07.920 --> 00:12:11.040 line:100%
Wait. I have a photo of him.

00:12:11.120 --> 00:12:12.040 line:100%
Let me show you.

00:12:22.200 --> 00:12:24.520 line:100%
This one. This one here.
The one with glasses.

00:12:25.960 --> 00:12:27.040 line:100%
This?

00:12:27.120 --> 00:12:28.280 line:100%
The man with glasses.

00:12:29.440 --> 00:12:31.720 line:100%
<i>The person who hired you,</i>
<i>what's their name?</i>

00:12:31.800 --> 00:12:33.080 line:100%
<i>What do they look like?</i>

00:12:33.160 --> 00:12:34.200 line:100%
<i>A man.</i>

00:12:34.920 --> 00:12:37.400 line:100%
He looks about 25 or 26.

00:12:37.480 --> 00:12:39.120 line:100%
Tall.

00:12:39.200 --> 00:12:40.640 line:100%
Wears glasses.

00:12:40.720 --> 00:12:42.000 line:100%
Side-parted hair.

00:12:42.080 --> 00:12:43.960 line:100%
<i>Looks well-mannered.</i>

00:12:49.200 --> 00:12:51.800 line:20%
USE WITH CARE, ECO-RECYCLE

00:12:53.560 --> 00:12:54.400 line:100%
Let's do it now.

00:12:55.920 --> 00:12:56.800 line:100%
Are you sure?

00:12:59.680 --> 00:13:01.400 line:100%
Who the heck are you?

00:13:02.280 --> 00:13:04.160 line:100%
Do you know who my boss is?

00:13:06.480 --> 00:13:07.520 line:100%
Who?

00:13:08.320 --> 00:13:09.600 line:100%
You.

00:13:09.680 --> 00:13:11.160 line:100%
Get lost.

00:13:19.440 --> 00:13:20.520 line:100%
Let's go home and have dumplings.

00:13:20.600 --> 00:13:21.760 line:100%
You're home.

00:13:26.800 --> 00:13:27.960 line:100%
My goodness.

00:13:29.840 --> 00:13:31.880 line:100%
-Sir.
-Green hair. Panda eyes.

00:13:32.640 --> 00:13:34.280 line:100%
Torn pants. A dog collar.

00:13:34.360 --> 00:13:37.400 line:100%
I'm raising a kid, not some freak.

00:13:37.480 --> 00:13:39.480 line:100%
He Yuanhang, what did you promise me?

00:13:39.560 --> 00:13:41.080 line:100%
If I'd known, I would've gone
to the provincial capital with my mom.

00:13:42.440 --> 00:13:43.720 line:100%
You think I don't keep my word?

00:13:43.800 --> 00:13:45.040 line:100%
I used to just be your dad.

00:13:45.120 --> 00:13:47.440 line:100%
Now I'm playing both parents.

00:13:47.520 --> 00:13:48.800 line:100%
Look at you.

00:13:48.880 --> 00:13:50.640 line:100%
Dye your hair today, tattoo tomorrow.

00:13:50.720 --> 00:13:52.040 line:100%
What's next, drugs?

00:13:52.120 --> 00:13:53.720 line:100%
You're a student, you know that?

00:13:53.800 --> 00:13:54.760 line:100%
School is for idiots.

00:13:54.840 --> 00:13:55.920 line:100%
I'm doing rock.

00:13:56.000 --> 00:13:57.280 line:100%
That's real rock spirit.

00:14:03.240 --> 00:14:04.720 line:100%
Rock spirit, my foot.

00:14:04.800 --> 00:14:06.640 line:100%
More like rock nutcase.

00:14:07.880 --> 00:14:09.360 line:100%
And she still has the nerve
to eat my dumplings?

00:14:16.720 --> 00:14:20.000 line:100%
What's wrong with her?
Am I pushing her too hard?

00:14:24.960 --> 00:14:25.960 line:100%
Take it easy.

00:14:26.560 --> 00:14:27.440 line:100%
I'm not drinking.

00:14:29.400 --> 00:14:31.600 line:100%
Teenagers are like this, right?

00:14:33.520 --> 00:14:34.800 line:100%
Anyway,

00:14:35.320 --> 00:14:38.360 line:100%
Xiaohe may be rebellious, but she's smart.

00:14:38.440 --> 00:14:41.800 line:100%
She scored over 95 in every subject
on the mock exam.

00:14:44.080 --> 00:14:46.040 line:100%
Her homeroom teacher told me.

00:14:47.000 --> 00:14:48.440 line:100%
MR. ZHANG

00:14:49.920 --> 00:14:51.400 line:100%
Hello, Mr. Zhang?

00:14:52.200 --> 00:14:54.240 line:100%
Now the teacher doesn't even know
whether to praise her

00:14:54.320 --> 00:14:55.160 line:100%
or scold her.

00:14:55.240 --> 00:14:56.880 line:100%
<i>He Xiaohe skipped school</i>
<i>five days this week.</i>

00:14:56.960 --> 00:14:59.000 line:100%
<i>Her total score didn't even reach 95.</i>

00:14:59.080 --> 00:15:00.760 line:100%
I'm so sorry, Mr. Zhang.

00:15:01.280 --> 00:15:02.640 line:100%
Please calm down. I'll handle it.

00:15:02.720 --> 00:15:03.560 line:100%
I'll deal with it right away.

00:15:05.000 --> 00:15:07.480 line:100%
Xiaohe is brain and brawn.

00:15:07.560 --> 00:15:11.080 line:100%
She might turn out to be
a great criminal investigator.

00:15:16.240 --> 00:15:18.520 line:100%
She's good for the physical side.

00:15:18.600 --> 00:15:20.040 line:100%
I've trained her myself
since she was little.

00:15:20.120 --> 00:15:22.200 line:100%
She's even better than you.

00:15:23.480 --> 00:15:24.800 line:100%
But academically…

00:15:26.280 --> 00:15:27.640 line:100%
Ninety-five in every subject?

00:15:28.560 --> 00:15:29.640 line:100%
Yeah, 95 in every subject.

00:15:39.280 --> 00:15:40.240 line:100%
Ninety-five in every subject…

00:15:40.320 --> 00:15:41.560 line:100%
Sir.

00:15:43.000 --> 00:15:45.200 line:100%
-Disability allowance for this month.
-I don't want it.

00:15:45.800 --> 00:15:47.760 line:100%
The label doesn't feel right.
Taking it feels wrong.

00:15:47.840 --> 00:15:49.280 line:100%
Disability allowance.

00:15:49.360 --> 00:15:51.040 line:100%
It reminds me every month
that I'm disabled.

00:15:52.200 --> 00:15:54.040 line:100%
When can I return to the team?

00:15:55.240 --> 00:15:57.640 line:100%
You're not fully recovered yet.

00:15:58.160 --> 00:16:00.760 line:100%
Besides, you haven't been idle.

00:16:01.360 --> 00:16:04.200 line:100%
I know you've been looking into Xu Meng.

00:16:15.960 --> 00:16:17.760 line:100%
I'm injured now.

00:16:18.720 --> 00:16:20.360 line:100%
There's nothing else I can do.

00:16:20.440 --> 00:16:22.480 line:100%
I might as well see this case through

00:16:23.480 --> 00:16:25.520 line:100%
and give myself some closure.

00:16:30.600 --> 00:16:32.160 line:100%
The Yuanlongli case

00:16:32.680 --> 00:16:33.840 line:100%
feels like it's done,

00:16:34.720 --> 00:16:36.320 line:100%
but not really.

00:16:38.040 --> 00:16:40.280 line:100%
Feels like something's
still hanging over it.

00:16:42.240 --> 00:16:44.400 line:100%
That's why I want to dig deeper.

00:16:44.480 --> 00:16:47.280 line:100%
I found out Xu Meng had a boyfriend

00:16:47.360 --> 00:16:49.160 line:100%
named Wan Qiming.

00:16:50.440 --> 00:16:53.040 line:100%
This man is suspicious.

00:16:53.120 --> 00:16:55.320 line:100%
I'm planning to head out of town
and meet him.

00:16:56.000 --> 00:16:58.800 line:100%
-Out of town?
-You don't have to come with me.

00:16:59.560 --> 00:17:02.320 line:100%
You're the captain.
You have plenty on your plate.

00:17:02.400 --> 00:17:05.680 line:100%
If I find anything, I'll keep you posted.

00:17:18.680 --> 00:17:19.800 line:100%
Captain,

00:17:19.879 --> 00:17:22.800 line:100%
this is Luandongzi's statement.
Take a look.

00:17:22.879 --> 00:17:24.480 line:100%
-Did he talk?
-He did.

00:17:25.320 --> 00:17:26.200 line:100%
Not just that,

00:17:27.360 --> 00:17:29.000 line:100%
he took all the blame.

00:17:29.080 --> 00:17:30.560 line:100%
He didn't mention anything
about his accomplices.

00:17:32.720 --> 00:17:34.360 line:100%
We worked this hard to bring him in.

00:17:34.440 --> 00:17:37.440 line:100%
If he keeps his mouth shut,
we'll never get the others.

00:17:48.880 --> 00:17:49.720 line:100%
The cop takes out a knife.

00:17:53.720 --> 00:17:54.760 line:100%
You scared me.

00:17:57.880 --> 00:17:58.760 line:100%
Captain Ran.

00:18:20.320 --> 00:18:21.800 line:100%
I heard you confessed to everything.

00:18:22.760 --> 00:18:24.160 line:100%
Captain Ran,

00:18:24.240 --> 00:18:27.600 line:100%
well, I like coming clean. Come clean.

00:18:34.800 --> 00:18:37.600 line:100%
You took 1.5 million in cash
from the Railway Administration

00:18:39.120 --> 00:18:40.480 line:100%
all alone?

00:18:40.560 --> 00:18:43.440 line:100%
That's right.
I brought it out all by myself.

00:18:44.840 --> 00:18:46.880 line:100%
The compound is huge.

00:18:46.960 --> 00:18:51.120 line:100%
Four security teams.
Patrols every five minutes.

00:18:51.200 --> 00:18:54.440 line:100%
How did you get out
carrying all that cash?

00:18:55.880 --> 00:18:57.480 line:100%
I just saw my chance and took it.

00:18:57.560 --> 00:18:59.960 line:100%
There happened to be
a heavy downpour that day.

00:19:00.040 --> 00:19:01.480 line:100%
It really covered for me.

00:19:01.560 --> 00:19:03.120 line:100%
Goodness.

00:19:06.160 --> 00:19:07.880 line:100%
Don't get worked up.

00:19:09.360 --> 00:19:12.480 line:100%
Yesterday, you shouted that you wanted
to report Qian Dajun from Yuanlongli.

00:19:12.560 --> 00:19:13.720 line:100%
What's that about?

00:19:14.280 --> 00:19:16.240 line:100%
I was talking nonsense.

00:19:16.320 --> 00:19:18.720 line:100%
You know my line of work.

00:19:18.800 --> 00:19:19.960 line:100%
High pressure.

00:19:20.040 --> 00:19:23.240 line:100%
Sometimes you have to let it out.

00:19:28.960 --> 00:19:30.920 line:100%
Come. Let's go out.

00:19:34.080 --> 00:19:35.160 line:100%
INTERROGATION ROOM

00:19:38.440 --> 00:19:39.720 line:100%
Let your pressure out.

00:19:39.800 --> 00:19:40.800 line:100%
Take him out.

00:19:44.200 --> 00:19:46.040 line:100%
Didn't you hear? Let my pressure out.

00:19:47.120 --> 00:19:48.520 line:100%
Jeez. Let your pressure out?

00:19:49.320 --> 00:19:51.240 line:100%
Cops can't hit just anyone.

00:19:52.320 --> 00:19:53.240 line:100%
Hands.

00:20:00.400 --> 00:20:01.240 line:100%
Captain Ran.

00:20:06.960 --> 00:20:08.560 line:100%
Let's say you're telling the truth.

00:20:08.640 --> 00:20:10.560 line:100%
The distance from
the Railway Administration building

00:20:10.640 --> 00:20:12.880 line:100%
to the back gate is 1,400 meters.

00:20:13.600 --> 00:20:15.720 line:100%
The perimeter of this field is 86 meters.

00:20:16.320 --> 00:20:19.280 line:100%
Divide 1,400 by 86, it's about 16 laps.

00:20:19.360 --> 00:20:22.280 line:100%
1.5 million in cash is under 20 kilograms.

00:20:23.040 --> 00:20:25.040 line:100%
This bag of rice is 15 kilograms.

00:20:25.560 --> 00:20:27.080 line:100%
Here.

00:20:27.160 --> 00:20:29.600 line:100%
Carry it. Run 15 laps.

00:20:30.440 --> 00:20:34.080 line:100%
I'll time you. Let's see if you can
dodge patrols within five minutes.

00:20:34.160 --> 00:20:36.120 line:100%
-Wait.
-Come. I'll keep time.

00:20:36.640 --> 00:20:37.920 line:100%
Ready.

00:20:38.000 --> 00:20:39.320 line:100%
-We'll run with you.
-Ready.

00:20:39.400 --> 00:20:41.320 line:100%
-Listen to me.
-Run.

00:20:43.280 --> 00:20:44.880 line:100%
-Faster.
-Run.

00:20:44.960 --> 00:20:46.680 line:100%
-Pick it up.
-Move it.

00:20:46.760 --> 00:20:48.040 line:100%
-Speed up.
-Faster.

00:20:48.120 --> 00:20:49.840 line:100%
-Speed up.
-Faster.

00:20:50.920 --> 00:20:52.800 line:100%
Faster.

00:20:52.880 --> 00:20:54.760 line:100%
Keep going.

00:20:54.840 --> 00:20:56.520 line:100%
Speed up.

00:20:56.600 --> 00:20:57.800 line:100%
-Faster.
-Thank you.

00:21:08.040 --> 00:21:10.200 line:100%
-One minute and 30 seconds.
-Not even two minutes yet.

00:21:10.280 --> 00:21:11.760 line:100%
Security hasn't come around.

00:21:11.840 --> 00:21:12.880 line:100%
Keep running.

00:21:12.960 --> 00:21:14.560 line:100%
-As fast as you can.
-Get up.

00:21:16.400 --> 00:21:17.600 line:100%
I'll talk.

00:21:17.680 --> 00:21:18.760 line:100%
I'll tell you everything.

00:21:19.360 --> 00:21:20.520 line:100%
Not just me,

00:21:21.040 --> 00:21:22.040 line:100%
there were three others.

00:21:22.640 --> 00:21:25.480 line:100%
Including me, there were four in total.

00:21:26.160 --> 00:21:27.400 line:100%
Here. Wipe your face.

00:21:29.120 --> 00:21:30.440 line:100%
Thank you.

00:21:34.720 --> 00:21:37.960 line:100%
-Tell me about Qian Dajun.
-Right.

00:21:38.920 --> 00:21:42.320 line:100%
There's an underground garage
in Yuanlongli, you know?

00:21:43.240 --> 00:21:45.680 line:100%
That money grabber has a stash down there.

00:21:45.760 --> 00:21:47.920 line:100%
A lot of valuables.

00:21:52.480 --> 00:21:53.640 line:100%
Officer Ran,

00:21:54.480 --> 00:21:56.560 line:100%
what are you doing
in the underground garage?

00:21:56.640 --> 00:21:57.800 line:100%
<i>I saw it with my own eyes.</i>

00:21:57.880 --> 00:21:59.520 line:100%
He carried a safe inside.

00:21:59.600 --> 00:22:00.960 line:100%
When he came out,

00:22:01.480 --> 00:22:03.320 line:100%
the safe was gone.

00:22:03.920 --> 00:22:05.920 line:100%
I believe something's off for sure.

00:22:17.440 --> 00:22:18.280 line:100%
Mr. Qian,

00:22:18.800 --> 00:22:20.800 line:100%
aren't you opening up slots
for rental next month?

00:22:21.440 --> 00:22:23.880 line:100%
Could you maybe squeeze us in early?

00:22:23.960 --> 00:22:27.200 line:100%
MANAGER'S OFFICE

00:22:27.280 --> 00:22:27.880 line:100%
CHUNGHWA CIGARETTE

00:22:34.560 --> 00:22:36.760 line:100%
Officer Ran. How may I help?

00:22:38.440 --> 00:22:40.160 line:100%
Carry on. I'll wait outside.

00:22:40.840 --> 00:22:42.080 line:100%
Alright.

00:22:44.560 --> 00:22:45.400 line:100%
What do you mean?

00:22:45.920 --> 00:22:48.280 line:100%
Cut the line? That's not happening.

00:22:48.360 --> 00:22:50.440 line:100%
The management team follows the rules.

00:22:50.960 --> 00:22:52.320 line:100%
Take it away. Everything.

00:22:52.400 --> 00:22:53.800 line:100%
-Mr. Qian.
-Remember this.

00:22:53.880 --> 00:22:56.160 line:100%
Handle everything by the book.
Open and transparent.

00:22:56.240 --> 00:22:57.680 line:100%
No backdoor dealings.

00:22:58.200 --> 00:23:00.120 line:100%
-Got it.
-Officer Ran.

00:23:00.200 --> 00:23:01.720 line:20%
ROAD WORK AHEAD, STAY SAFE

00:23:07.160 --> 00:23:08.280 line:100%
Officer Ran.

00:23:08.880 --> 00:23:09.760 line:100%
Look,

00:23:11.160 --> 00:23:14.120 line:100%
there's nothing here. Just consumables.

00:23:23.080 --> 00:23:25.120 line:100%
Really. It's nothing.

00:23:25.720 --> 00:23:26.920 line:100%
All junk.

00:23:32.960 --> 00:23:34.800 line:100%
Officer Ran, these are just empty boxes.

00:23:34.880 --> 00:23:36.160 line:100%
Just…

00:23:47.600 --> 00:23:48.720 line:100%
Open it.

00:23:51.960 --> 00:23:53.680 line:100%
It's been here too long.

00:23:53.760 --> 00:23:55.040 line:100%
I forgot the passcode.

00:23:56.760 --> 00:23:57.600 line:100%
Forgot?

00:24:00.360 --> 00:24:02.080 line:100%
Then you and the boxes can come with me.

00:24:03.240 --> 00:24:04.680 line:100%
I remember. I remember.

00:24:04.760 --> 00:24:05.600 line:100%
I remember now.

00:24:30.000 --> 00:24:31.040 line:100%
Where's the thing?

00:24:32.600 --> 00:24:33.440 line:100%
What thing?

00:24:36.040 --> 00:24:40.040 line:100%
Qian Dajun, someone reported you
for embezzling public assets.

00:24:40.120 --> 00:24:42.320 line:100%
Officer Ran, I'm innocent.

00:24:42.400 --> 00:24:44.960 line:100%
These… These are all
discarded supplies and consumables

00:24:45.040 --> 00:24:46.400 line:100%
from the property office.

00:24:46.480 --> 00:24:49.080 line:100%
I just wanted to sell them off
for a little cash.

00:24:58.640 --> 00:25:00.000 line:100%
Mr. Qian,

00:25:00.600 --> 00:25:02.400 line:100%
a word to the wise.

00:25:02.480 --> 00:25:04.400 line:100%
Taking advantage can cost you big.

00:25:04.480 --> 00:25:05.920 line:100%
Yes. Right.

00:25:06.000 --> 00:25:08.320 line:100%
Don't worry. I'll make
all this disappear. Right away.

00:26:25.200 --> 00:26:27.160 line:100%
-Hello.
-Hello.

00:26:27.680 --> 00:26:28.840 line:100%
This man with glasses.

00:26:28.920 --> 00:26:30.600 line:100%
Is he a photographer here?

00:26:30.680 --> 00:26:32.200 line:100%
His style is unique.

00:26:32.840 --> 00:26:34.920 line:100%
He's not just the photographer,
he owns this place.

00:26:35.000 --> 00:26:35.960 line:100%
I see.

00:26:37.240 --> 00:26:38.240 line:100%
Is he a local?

00:26:38.320 --> 00:26:41.320 line:100%
Why are so many of his photos
taken by the sea?

00:26:41.400 --> 00:26:43.360 line:100%
He used to work in Guangdong.

00:26:43.440 --> 00:26:45.360 line:100%
Only came back last year
to open this place.

00:26:47.880 --> 00:26:49.040 line:100%
This one.

00:26:50.040 --> 00:26:51.480 line:100%
Guangdong's phone number.

00:26:56.320 --> 00:26:58.680 line:100%
Well. I'm from a magazine.

00:26:58.760 --> 00:27:00.920 line:100%
I really like his style.

00:27:01.000 --> 00:27:03.760 line:100%
Could I talk to him
about a possible collaboration?

00:27:03.840 --> 00:27:06.200 line:100%
Bad timing. He's out of town on a shoot.

00:27:06.280 --> 00:27:07.440 line:100%
I see.

00:27:08.000 --> 00:27:08.840 line:100%
When will he be back?

00:27:09.640 --> 00:27:10.920 line:100%
Hard to say.

00:27:12.720 --> 00:27:15.040 line:100%
If you need this,
you can try calling his mobile.

00:27:15.120 --> 00:27:17.640 line:100%
But when he's out on field trips,
he usually keeps his phone off.

00:27:17.720 --> 00:27:19.040 line:100%
Alright. Thank you.

00:27:19.560 --> 00:27:20.760 line:20%
WAN QIMING'S BUSINESS CARD

00:27:54.960 --> 00:27:55.840 line:100%
Sorry.

00:27:55.920 --> 00:27:57.320 line:100%
This is Mr. Wan's private workspace.

00:27:57.400 --> 00:27:59.000 line:100%
-Not open to visitors.
-Right.

00:27:59.080 --> 00:28:00.680 line:100%
It does look quite unique inside.

00:28:00.760 --> 00:28:02.400 line:100%
Mr. Wan has a wide range of interests.

00:28:02.480 --> 00:28:06.160 line:100%
He collects antique knives.
He loves making specimens.

00:28:09.080 --> 00:28:10.720 line:100%
Where did he go for his field trip?

00:28:16.840 --> 00:28:20.720 line:100%
CAROUSEL'S DEAD HEAT

00:28:41.280 --> 00:28:43.480 line:100%
SPINNING CAROUSEL

00:28:48.600 --> 00:28:49.480 line:100%
Xiaohe.

00:28:49.560 --> 00:28:52.120 line:100%
-Xiaohe is here.
-Look who's here.

00:28:52.200 --> 00:28:53.960 line:100%
-Say hi.
-Officer Ran, hello.

00:28:54.760 --> 00:28:56.120 line:100%
Hello, guys.

00:28:56.840 --> 00:28:58.840 line:100%
Same as usual.
I'll pick you up in two hours.

00:28:59.760 --> 00:29:00.800 line:100%
You're not staying to watch the rehearsal?

00:29:01.400 --> 00:29:04.400 line:100%
I have plans. Record it.
I'll listen later at home.

00:29:06.200 --> 00:29:09.360 line:100%
You guys go ahead. Wait.

00:29:10.200 --> 00:29:12.760 line:100%
Uncle Ran, you're going on a date, right?

00:29:12.840 --> 00:29:14.760 line:100%
I saw you texting in the car just now.

00:29:14.840 --> 00:29:16.320 line:100%
You were blushing.

00:29:18.960 --> 00:29:21.360 line:100%
You don't show up empty-handed for a date.

00:29:27.680 --> 00:29:28.640 line:100%
Ms. Qiao will like it.

00:29:29.560 --> 00:29:31.120 line:100%
It's not that.

00:29:31.200 --> 00:29:33.200 line:100%
Uncle Ran, trust me.

00:29:33.280 --> 00:29:36.360 line:100%
I've watched way more dramas
than cases you've worked on.

00:29:36.440 --> 00:29:37.280 line:100%
Take it.

00:29:38.160 --> 00:29:39.440 line:100%
Take it.

00:30:07.000 --> 00:30:08.240 line:100%
Welcome.

00:30:14.920 --> 00:30:15.960 line:100%
Have you been waiting long?

00:30:17.600 --> 00:30:18.720 line:100%
I just got here.

00:30:28.320 --> 00:30:31.000 line:100%
I picked this cake up on the way just now.

00:30:31.080 --> 00:30:32.280 line:100%
It's for you.

00:30:35.800 --> 00:30:37.040 line:100%
Thank you.

00:30:47.920 --> 00:30:49.280 line:100%
This is

00:30:49.840 --> 00:30:51.360 line:100%
for me?

00:30:52.440 --> 00:30:53.280 line:100%
Yes.

00:30:56.520 --> 00:30:57.400 line:100%
It's from Xiaohe.

00:30:58.680 --> 00:31:00.440 line:100%
I just brought it over.

00:31:09.680 --> 00:31:10.720 line:100%
Thank you.

00:31:27.480 --> 00:31:28.440 line:100%
<i>Freedom, freedom</i>

00:31:28.520 --> 00:31:30.840 line:100%
<i>It's burning</i>

00:31:30.920 --> 00:31:34.160 line:100%
<i>Close your eyes, get some rest</i>

00:31:34.240 --> 00:31:35.080 line:100%
<i>Run, run</i>

00:31:37.200 --> 00:31:38.760 line:100%
What the heck is this?

00:31:38.840 --> 00:31:40.160 line:100%
Who did this?

00:31:40.240 --> 00:31:41.360 line:100%
Come out here.

00:31:41.440 --> 00:31:43.680 line:100%
-Who turned on the light? Come out here.
-Come out!

00:31:47.960 --> 00:31:48.840 line:100%
Dad.

00:31:48.920 --> 00:31:50.400 line:100%
Why are you back?

00:31:52.400 --> 00:31:54.000 line:100%
My dear son,

00:31:54.560 --> 00:31:56.040 line:100%
you really didn't disappoint me.

00:31:56.120 --> 00:31:57.160 line:100%
Dad, let me explain.

00:31:57.240 --> 00:31:58.320 line:100%
Explain it to my belt.

00:31:58.400 --> 00:32:00.440 line:100%
-Stand right there! Stand right there!
-Dad.

00:32:00.520 --> 00:32:01.640 line:100%
-I was wrong.
-Stop!

00:32:01.720 --> 00:32:02.960 line:100%
-You're still running?
-Run.

00:32:03.040 --> 00:32:03.920 line:100%
Don't run.

00:32:04.480 --> 00:32:06.360 line:100%
Stand right there. Don't run!

00:32:07.360 --> 00:32:08.600 line:100%
Run.

00:32:11.280 --> 00:32:13.280 line:100%
Not this way. The door's locked. Go.

00:32:17.200 --> 00:32:17.920 line:100%
Why are you running?

00:32:19.960 --> 00:32:21.120 line:100%
Where's the other girl?

00:32:44.080 --> 00:32:45.160 line:100%
Your guitar looks cool.

00:32:46.720 --> 00:32:49.400 line:100%
Mister, where did you get it?

00:32:49.480 --> 00:32:50.800 line:100%
You can't buy this anywhere.

00:33:01.680 --> 00:33:04.560 line:100%
<i>The summer solstice wind</i>
<i>Still blows at dusk</i>

00:33:05.920 --> 00:33:08.160 line:100%
<i>It passes the moon</i>

00:33:08.240 --> 00:33:10.720 line:100%
<i>Tracing the brows</i>

00:33:12.680 --> 00:33:15.720 line:100%
<i>The world under the moon is bustling</i>

00:33:16.920 --> 00:33:18.960 line:100%
<i>Yet I have no idea</i>

00:33:19.040 --> 00:33:21.120 line:100%
<i>Where I should go</i>

00:33:23.720 --> 00:33:26.160 line:100%
<i>Oh, youth</i>

00:33:26.240 --> 00:33:28.960 line:100%
<i>So dazzling, so vast</i>

00:33:29.040 --> 00:33:31.600 line:100%
<i>Dreams fill a young heart</i>

00:33:31.680 --> 00:33:36.600 line:100%
<i>Yet they're beyond reach</i>

00:33:45.760 --> 00:33:47.760 line:100%
Teach me that.
I'll take you as my teacher.

00:33:48.880 --> 00:33:52.160 line:100%
I'm leaving Weiyang tomorrow
for another city.

00:33:52.760 --> 00:33:55.400 line:100%
Busking? I'll go with you.

00:33:55.480 --> 00:33:57.240 line:100%
That's one man's adventure.

00:34:00.040 --> 00:34:01.080 line:100%
Girl,

00:34:01.600 --> 00:34:03.320 line:100%
if you really want to learn,

00:34:03.400 --> 00:34:04.320 line:100%
go to Beijing.

00:34:04.400 --> 00:34:06.320 line:100%
That's where rock started in China.

00:34:10.519 --> 00:34:11.720 line:100%
Beijing?

00:34:16.120 --> 00:34:17.999 line:100%
I'm planning to move next week

00:34:18.080 --> 00:34:20.519 line:100%
to somewhere closer to work.

00:34:20.600 --> 00:34:22.200 line:100%
I'm sharing a place with others.

00:34:26.680 --> 00:34:27.880 line:100%
Don't rush.

00:34:27.959 --> 00:34:30.280 line:100%
The unit just assigned me an apartment.

00:34:30.360 --> 00:34:33.640 line:100%
I'm alone and used to the dorm.
I don't need it.

00:34:33.720 --> 00:34:36.039 line:100%
If you don't mind, you can move in.

00:34:36.680 --> 00:34:38.439 line:100%
I can't do that.

00:34:38.519 --> 00:34:40.400 line:100%
It's assigned to you. It's not appropriate

00:34:40.479 --> 00:34:42.680 line:100%
-for me to move in.
-It's fine.

00:34:42.760 --> 00:34:44.200 line:100%
You've been living alone.

00:34:44.280 --> 00:34:46.920 line:100%
You won't get used to sharing.

00:34:48.959 --> 00:34:50.640 line:100%
Thank you, Ran.

00:34:50.720 --> 00:34:51.760 line:100%
But no.

00:34:56.720 --> 00:34:58.120 line:100%
Honestly,

00:34:58.720 --> 00:35:00.240 line:100%
as long as there's no ghost,

00:35:01.080 --> 00:35:02.880 line:100%
a little discomfort

00:35:03.520 --> 00:35:05.040 line:100%
doesn't matter.

00:35:12.160 --> 00:35:15.560 line:100%
That old man gave me food,

00:35:16.480 --> 00:35:17.480 line:100%
money,

00:35:18.800 --> 00:35:20.440 line:100%
and a place to stay.

00:35:22.240 --> 00:35:23.360 line:100%
But

00:35:27.320 --> 00:35:29.360 line:100%
he never gave me dignity.

00:35:37.440 --> 00:35:39.160 line:100%
<i>He was weak and afraid of light.</i>

00:35:40.000 --> 00:35:43.120 line:100%
<i>Not a single ray of sunlight</i>
<i>was allowed inside.</i>

00:35:44.720 --> 00:35:46.160 line:100%
You trying to burn me?

00:35:52.080 --> 00:35:53.080 line:100%
<i>Back then,</i>

00:35:55.160 --> 00:35:57.400 line:100%
<i>I never slept well</i>

00:35:58.800 --> 00:36:00.640 line:100%
<i>or had a proper meal.</i>

00:36:06.440 --> 00:36:07.600 line:100%
Come here.

00:36:11.840 --> 00:36:13.000 line:100%
Faster.

00:36:15.240 --> 00:36:16.520 line:100%
Wipe it.

00:36:26.960 --> 00:36:28.080 line:100%
You trollop.

00:36:35.760 --> 00:36:36.800 line:100%
Did you try to put me to sleep?

00:36:37.600 --> 00:36:39.200 line:100%
Did you? Did you?

00:36:39.280 --> 00:36:40.640 line:100%
-You want me…
-No!

00:36:40.720 --> 00:36:42.080 line:100%
asleep all the time?

00:36:42.160 --> 00:36:43.000 line:100%
Right?

00:36:51.520 --> 00:36:53.320 line:100%
He treated you like that.

00:36:53.840 --> 00:36:55.800 line:100%
Why did you stay and take care of him?

00:36:57.080 --> 00:37:00.600 line:100%
He had a bad temper
and drove off every caretaker.

00:37:00.680 --> 00:37:02.360 line:100%
No one else would take the job.

00:37:02.880 --> 00:37:05.480 line:100%
So the pay was high.

00:37:06.400 --> 00:37:08.640 line:100%
My mom had just passed.

00:37:09.240 --> 00:37:11.520 line:100%
I was buried in debt.

00:37:12.120 --> 00:37:15.480 line:100%
I couldn't find anything that paid better.

00:37:21.840 --> 00:37:22.960 line:100%
Qiao.

00:37:23.840 --> 00:37:26.040 line:100%
You were miserable at Yuanlongli.

00:37:26.640 --> 00:37:27.720 line:100%
After he died,

00:37:28.400 --> 00:37:29.760 line:100%
why didn't you move out?

00:37:30.800 --> 00:37:32.760 line:100%
His son's overseas.

00:37:32.840 --> 00:37:35.200 line:100%
He asked me to watch the place,

00:37:35.280 --> 00:37:36.520 line:100%
and it's rent-free.

00:37:37.120 --> 00:37:39.360 line:100%
But he's coming back soon.

00:37:41.280 --> 00:37:44.080 line:100%
Ran, I'm not trying to take advantage.

00:37:44.680 --> 00:37:46.320 line:100%
I've wanted to move out for a while.

00:37:47.160 --> 00:37:48.040 line:100%
It's just…

00:37:56.040 --> 00:37:58.800 line:100%
I thought maybe

00:37:59.600 --> 00:38:03.000 line:100%
I'd run into you again if I stayed there.

00:38:10.920 --> 00:38:12.840 line:100%
Qiao, I…

00:38:15.600 --> 00:38:18.080 line:100%
Ran, don't be nervous.

00:38:19.640 --> 00:38:21.480 line:100%
I know I'm not good enough for you.

00:38:21.560 --> 00:38:23.480 line:100%
I… No.

00:38:25.240 --> 00:38:26.960 line:100%
That's not what I meant.

00:38:28.520 --> 00:38:31.360 line:100%
Saying this out loud

00:38:32.240 --> 00:38:34.000 line:100%
makes me feel better.

00:38:44.480 --> 00:38:50.000 line:100%
YUNSHAN ZIZHU RESTAURANT

00:38:57.880 --> 00:39:00.360 line:100%
It's cold out here. I can give you a ride.

00:39:00.440 --> 00:39:01.680 line:100%
No need.

00:39:01.760 --> 00:39:04.360 line:100%
The office is around here. I'll just walk.

00:39:04.880 --> 00:39:06.160 line:100%
You should get back to work.

00:39:09.280 --> 00:39:10.600 line:100%
Hey.

00:39:12.440 --> 00:39:14.280 line:100%
-Are you alright?
-I'm fine.

00:39:16.280 --> 00:39:18.400 line:100%
It's okay. You don't
have to keep the flower.

00:39:19.520 --> 00:39:20.360 line:100%
No.

00:39:21.600 --> 00:39:23.400 line:100%
You gave it to me.

00:39:23.480 --> 00:39:24.800 line:100%
I won't let it get dirty.

00:40:12.520 --> 00:40:13.480 line:100%
Step back a bit.

00:40:13.560 --> 00:40:14.720 line:100%
The ambulance is coming.

00:40:14.800 --> 00:40:16.040 line:100%
Make way.

00:40:20.440 --> 00:40:21.560 line:100%
Back up.

00:40:24.680 --> 00:40:26.280 line:100%
Back up.

00:40:29.000 --> 00:40:31.280 line:100%
Look. A kid died in the fire.

00:40:31.360 --> 00:40:32.600 line:100%
Choked on the smoke. Didn't make it out.

00:40:33.560 --> 00:40:35.440 line:100%
Make way. Make way.

00:40:35.520 --> 00:40:36.880 line:100%
Make way. Ran Fangxu from Nanshan Branch.

00:40:38.120 --> 00:40:39.120 line:100%
AMBULANCE